  "title": "Beer-Marinated Deer Jerky",
  "description": "For this recipe, lean deer meat is marinated overnight in beer to develop deep flavors and then dehydrated to become jerky. It's worth the time to make.",
  "authors": [
    "Phillip Miller"
  ],
  "date_published": "2009-02-18T22:03:02-05:00",
